libxslt 1.1.43 (https://download.gnome.org/sources/libxslt/1.1/libxslt-1.1.43.tar.xz,
sha256 5a3d6b383ca5afc235b171118e90f5ff6aa27e9fea3303065231a6d403f0183a, the
version nokogiri 1.19.1's dependencies.yml pins): the sources and headers of
libxslt/ and libexslt/ needed to build them (tests, docs, python, xsltproc,
win32, vms, the build system, trio.h / triodef.h / win32config.h dropped),
unmodified.

nokogiri 1.19.1's only libxslt patch,
0001-update-config.guess-and-config.sub-for-libxslt.patch, touches the
autotools build system alone, so nothing here differs from upstream.

libxslt/xsltconfig.h and libexslt/exsltconfig.h are generated by build.rs
from the .in templates (debug, debugger and profiler on; trio, modules and
crypto off); config.h is ../../config/xslt-config.h.
